WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.350
(audience cheering)

00:00:05.223 --> 00:00:06.091
("Blue Christmas" by Elvis Presley)

00:00:06.091 --> 00:00:11.091
♪ I'll have a blue Christmas ♪

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:15.960
♪ Without you ♪

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:20.793
♪ I'll be so blue just
thinking about you ♪

00:00:27.192 --> 00:00:32.161
♪ Decorations of red ♪

00:00:32.161 --> 00:00:37.161
♪ On a green Christmas tree ♪

00:00:38.759 --> 00:00:43.759
♪ Won't be the same dear,
if you're not here with me ♪

00:00:46.714 --> 00:00:48.631
♪ Yeah ♪

00:00:57.606 --> 00:00:59.603
Give it up for Jason, y'all!

00:00:59.603 --> 00:01:02.436
(audience cheers)

00:01:03.849 --> 00:01:04.682
Yeah!

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:11.920
♪ And when those blue snowflakes ♪

00:01:12.782 --> 00:01:16.688
♪ Start falling ♪

00:01:16.688 --> 00:01:21.688
♪ That's when those blue memories ♪

00:01:22.752 --> 00:01:27.552
♪ Start calling ♪

00:01:27.552 --> 00:01:32.552
♪ You'll be doing all right ♪

00:01:32.869 --> 00:01:37.869
♪ With your Christmas of white ♪

00:01:38.886 --> 00:01:43.886
♪ But I'll have a blue,
blue, blue, blue Christmas ♪

00:01:48.411 --> 00:01:51.328
(audience cheers)

